        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "For the most part this is working great, but the output of `:set option?` is always `v:lua`, which is misleading:\r\n\r\n```\r\n[~]$ nvim -l - <<<'\r\n> vim.o.foldexpr = function() end\r\n> vim.cmd[[set foldexpr?]]\r\n> '\r\n  foldexpr=v:lua\r\n\tLast set from Lua (run Nvim with -V1 for more details)\r\n```\r\n\r\n(I can open a dedicated issue if you'd like, but I figured I may as well just mention it here)",
            "created_at": "2026-08-01T02:41:46Z",
